# Allowlist: only what the server image is built from enters the build context. Everything else
# (local configuration, build output, node_modules, documentation) stays out. Of the app and the
# sync crate only the manifests come in, which Cargo needs to read the workspace: a change to
# their code does not touch the image's build cache (server/Dockerfile).
*
!Cargo.toml
!Cargo.lock
!crates/hangar-drive-protocol/Cargo.toml
!crates/hangar-drive-protocol/src/
!crates/hangar-drive-crypto/Cargo.toml
!crates/hangar-drive-crypto/src/
!crates/hangar-drive-sync/Cargo.toml
!server/Cargo.toml
!server/src/
!server/migrations/
!src-tauri/Cargo.toml
**/target/
